A '''Psychic''' (Japanese: '''サイキッカー''' ''Psychicer'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that first debuted in the [[Generation I]] games. They were originally only male, but in [[Generation III]], female Psychics started to appear. In [[Generation VI]], the Trainer class once again reverts to all male, having found a female counterpart in {{tc|Hex Maniac}}s. They appear as young men or young women levitating {{i|Poké Ball}}s with their psychokinetic powers.

When paired with {{tc|Black Belt}}s in [[Double Battle]]s, they are called {{tc|Brains & Brawn}}s.

As their name suggests, they specialize in {{type|Psychic}} Pokémon, though they occasionally also use {{type|Ghost}} Pokémon from [[Generation III]] onward.

