==In animation==
[[File:Psychic {{#switch: {{#expr: {{#time: U}} mod 2}}|0=anime|1=DP051}}.png|thumb|250px|A Psychic in {{#switch: {{#expr: {{#time: U}} mod 2}}|0={{aniseries|OS}}|1={{aniseries|DP}}}}]]
A number of Psychics were seen in the [[Saffron Gym]] in ''[[EP022|Abra and the Psychic Showdown]]''.

Another Psychic appeared much later in ''[[DP051|Glory Blaze!]]'' as one of the participants of the [[Hearthome City Tag Battle Competition]]. There, he was partnered with a {{tc|Black Belt}} and faced off against {{Ash}} and [[Paul]] in the quarterfinals. Despite the two working well as a team, they were unable to contend against the experienced Trainers and were knocked out.

A Psychic named [[Ricky]] appeared in ''[[BW069|Climbing the Tower of Success!]]''. He is based on a Psychic named Bryce, who appeared in the [[Celestial Tower]] in the {{pkmn|games}}.

A large number of Psychics who train under [[Olympia]] appeared in ''[[XY092|Cloudy Fate, Bright Future!]]''. They included {{OBP|Carrie|XY092}} and [[Charlene]].

