===Pokémon Adventures===
===={{MangaArc|Yellow}}====
A male Psychic made a cameo appearance in a flashback in ''[[PS066|Punching Poliwrath]]'' as one of the Trainers that wanted to challenge {{adv|Red}} to a battle after his win at the Indigo League, but he was considered to be a "boring" match.

===={{MangaArc|HeartGold & SoulSilver}}====
A male Psychic was seen amongst the people visiting the {{safari|Johto}} in ''[[PS446|Weavile Wobbles But It Won't Fall Down]]''.

===={{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}}====
A male Psychic was one of the people swarming the [[Mossdeep Space Center]] in ''[[PS606|Diancie Shines]]''.

===={{MangaArc|Black & White}}====
In ''[[PS511|Dream a Little Dream]]'', a male and a female Psychic were seen as two of the 32 participants of the {{un|Pokémon League}} tournament, going through {{OBP|Victory Road|Black and White}}. They were eventually defeated off-panel, eliminating them from the tournament.

===={{MangaArc|X & Y}}====
In ''[[PS553|Sylveon Enchants]]'', a Psychic was seen at the Mini-game Corner.

