==Trivia==
* In the [[Pokémon Gold and Silver Spaceworld '97 demo]], the Psychic class was renamed to (Japanese: '''ちょうのうりょくしゃ''' ''Chōnōryokusha'', transl. ''Extrasensory Perception User''), but was reverted in the final release.
* There are no female Psychics outside of the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|IV}} in {{2v2|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}.
* In {{2v2|FireRed|LeafGreen}}, all female Psychics that can be battled are found in the [[Sevii Islands]].
* In [[Pokémon X and Y]], Psychic Robert makes a [[List of references to popular culture in Pokémon|reference]] to a meme spawned by the ''{{wp|Dragon Ball Z}}'' anime series, as he claims that the player and their Pokémon's power level is "over 9000". This reference is not present in the Japanese version.
* In [[Pokémon GO]], "Psychic" is the name of an achievement {{GO|medal}} awarded for catching at least 10 {{type|Psychic}} Pokémon.

